{
  "tema": 6126,
  "slug": "quepo-caber-presente",
  "titulo": "Caber in the present",
  "subtitulo": "No quepo en estos jeans.",
  "foto": "t03.jpg",
  "regla": "Caber (to fit) is regular in the present except for yo: quepo, cabes, cabe, cabemos, caben. The thing that fits is the subject.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Caber** means _to fit_ (to have enough room). In the present only **yo** is irregular: **quepo**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "Caber"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "**quepo**"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "cabes"
            ],
            [
              "él, ella, usted",
              "cabe"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros, nosotras",
              "cabemos"
            ],
            [
              "ellos, ellas, ustedes",
              "caben"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The thing that fits is the **subject**: **la tabla no cabe** (_the board doesn't fit_). With **caben**, plural things fit: **caben seis personas**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "To say _I can't fit X in_, turn it around: **X no cabe**, or **no me cabe X**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "For clothes: **no me caben** = I can't get into them; **no me quedan** = they don't fit me well."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Fixed phrase: **no me cabe duda** = _I have no doubt_."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "==No quepo== en estos jeans.",
              "en": "I don't fit into these jeans."
            },
            {
              "es": "La tabla larga no ==cabe== en mi carro.",
              "en": "The longboard doesn't fit in my car."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Cabemos== todos en tu camioneta?",
              "en": "Do we all fit in your truck?"
            },
            {
              "es": "En este elevador solo ==caben== seis personas.",
              "en": "Only six people fit in this elevator."
            },
            {
              "es": "Tú ==cabes== aquí, junto a mí.",
              "en": "You fit here, next to me."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Cabe== una cama más en el cuarto?",
              "en": "Does one more bed fit in the room?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Ya no ==caben== más macetas en la azotea.",
              "en": "No more pots fit on the roof."
            },
            {
              "es": "No me ==cabe== duda: es el mejor taco de Tijuana.",
              "en": "I have no doubt: it's the best taco in Tijuana."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
